<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JetFax started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JetFax started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of JetFax Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- JetFax launched its initial public offering on June 11.</p>
<p>-- JetFax lost 1/4 to 8-1/2.</p>
</text>
